# Product OS Architecture

This workspace is part of the Entrata Product OS. Three repos work together as siblings:

- `../prototype-sandbox/` -- Entrata design system, UI components, prototyping runtime
- `../product-spec-kit/` -- Shared skills, templates, onboarding, governance
- `./` -- This Product OS Workspace

All repos are in the `entrata-product` GitHub organization.
The `entrata` GitHub organization is engineering-only. PMs do not have write access.

# Key Paths

- Skills: discovered automatically from `../product-spec-kit/.cursor/skills/`
- Templates: `../product-spec-kit/artifacts/templates/`
- Design system rules: `../prototype-sandbox/CLAUDE.md`
- Components: `../prototype-sandbox/COMPONENTS.md`
- Terminology: `../product-spec-kit/artifacts/terminology.md`
- Personas: `../product-spec-kit/artifacts/personas.md`
